<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    The sunrise-gap note, and the "no times left" note, sit in a well.

    In the card that note is a GlassSurface with subtle:true — a nested surface
    sunk into the pane, radius AppRadius.sm, no border and no shadow. On the
    widget it was a bare line of grey text with nothing around it, which read as
    an afterthought rather than as the card's own considered answer to the one
    stretch of the day when no prayer is due.

    GlassTokens.fillSubtle is darker than the pane on paper and lighter than it
    on night — the well inverts with the mode, and values-night carries that.
-->
<shape xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:shape="rectangle">
    <solid android:color="@color/prayer_widget_well" />
    <corners android:radius="16dp" />
</shape>
